- Introduced LocalMessageIndex for storing and retrieving messages locally.
- Updated message sending to support encryption.
- Modified history handling to integrate decryption for displayed messages.
- Added Go tool for local message search with a web interface.
- Adjusted build configuration for the new Go tool and updated artifact handling in CI workflow.
